                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nywebo, mutaswiilili majwi aabasinsimi banu abasondi banu abasizilo to banu abasimizimu banu abasibadaimona banu, bamwaambila kuti, Tamukooyoobelekela mwami wa-Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo balamusinsimina cakubeja, aboobo muyootolwa kule kuzwa kunyika yanu. Njoomutanda mane mukalobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele kufumbwa musyobo uubika insingo yawo kunsi lyajoko lyamwami wa-Babuloni akumubelekela milimo, njoousia mpoonya awo anyika yawo, mbwaamba Jehova, kuti ulime nyika akukala alinjiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
