              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teensi ndime ndakabatuma, mbwaamba Jehova. Balasinsima zyakubeja buyo muzina lyangu, kuti nkamutande, aboobo muyooloba, inywe abasinsimi boonse bamusinsimina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
