        {
          "text": "Abalo bapaizi abantu aba boonse, ndakabaambila makani. Ndakati, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Mutaswiilili majwi aabasinsimi banu bamusinsimina kuti, Amubone! Zibelesyo zyaŋanda ya-Jehova zili kufwaafwi kuboozegwa kuzwa ku-Babuloni. Balamusinsimina zyakubeja buyo. ",
