          "text": "Nebukadinezara mwami wa-Babuloni nzyaatakatola ciindi eco naakatola mubuzike Jekoniya mwana wa-Jehoyakimu mwami wa-Juda, naakamugwisya kuzwa kuJerusalemu akumutola ku-Babuloni antoomwe abapati boonse ba-Juda aba-Jerusalemu. ",
